      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        221.356689453125,
        422.257080078125,
        234.70819091796875
      ],
      "text": "The use of corticosteroids as for drug-susceptible TB and for IRIS.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
